  augment /arcj:jails/arcj:jail:
    +---x address
       +---w input
       |  +---w address      string
       |  +---w interface?   string
       |  +---w remove?      boolean
       |  +---w live?        boolean
       |  +---w persist?     boolean
       |  +---w dry-run?     boolean
       +--ro output
          +--ro diff?   string

  structure network-part:
    +-- kind?         enumeration
    +-- family?       family
    +-- filter?       string
